#: neoseo.php
msgid "Gives Google the product data it needs to show your variants, prices, shipping and returns — ProductGroup variant markup, shipping details from your real zones, a connected JSON-LD graph and llms.txt. Stands aside automatically when a full SEO plugin is active."
