#: src/Admin/Settings.php:602
msgid "It runs automatically"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:603
msgid "There is nothing to add to your pages. NeoSEO reads the content you already have and prints the structured data in the page head."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:606
msgid "One connected graph"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:607
msgid "Every node is linked by @id, so search engines see one coherent description of the page instead of disconnected fragments."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:610
msgid "FAQ schema from Details blocks"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:611
msgid "Add two or more Details blocks to a page — question in the summary, answer inside — and NeoSEO turns them into FAQ schema."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:614
msgid "WooCommerce products"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:615
msgid "Price, currency, stock availability, SKU, ratings and reviews are read straight from the product. WooCommerce's own thinner markup is removed so there is exactly one product description."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:618
msgid "Answer engines and AI search"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:619
msgid "Articles carry speakable hints, and /llms.txt gives AI crawlers a compact, always-current summary of your site."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:624
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:627
msgid "How do I check my schema is valid?"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:628
msgid "Use the Schema inspector on the Dashboard tab to see the exact output, then follow the validator links below it to confirm with Google or Schema.org."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:632
msgid "I already use Yoast or Rank Math. Is this a conflict?"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:633
msgid "No. NeoSEO detects them and switches off its JSON-LD, meta description and Open Graph modules automatically, so none of that is output twice. Product variant markup stays on, because none of them produce it, and so does llms.txt. If your SEO plugin also generates an llms.txt, switch one of the two off."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:637
msgid "Do I need WooCommerce?"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:638
msgid "No. Product schema only activates when WooCommerce is installed; everything else works on any WordPress site."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:642
msgid "Why does my page show fewer nodes than another?"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:643
msgid "Each node describes something real. A page with no FAQ blocks has no FAQ node, and a post with no featured image has no image node. That is expected and correct."
msgstr ""

